      "title": "Exploring the Symbiotic Relationship between Digital Transformation, Infrastructure, Service Delivery, and Governance for Smart Sustainable Cities",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Dillip Kumar Das",
          "openalex_id": "A5058104427",
